@Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5021

### Registro
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana", "apellido": "Garcia", "email": "ana@correo.com", "password": "Password1!", "telefono": "999888777" }

### Login (copia el token a @token)
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@correo.com", "password": "Password1!" }

### Perfil
@token = pega-aqui-el-token
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: resumen de usuarios
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/admin/usuarios/resumen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: listar usuarios online
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/admin/usuarios?online=true&pagina=1&tamanoPagina=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
